<title>FINLAND: Tamrock Q1 pre-tax profit falls 23 pct.</title>
<headline>Tamrock Q1 pre-tax profit falls 23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to end-March,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax	27 vs 35</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   0.07 vs 0.10</p>
<p> Net sales					  1,123 vs 1,251</p>
<p> Operating profit				    37 vs 62</p>
<p> Depreciation					  46 vs 47</p>
<p> Net financial items			charge 10 vs 27 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				nil vs 13 gain</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	   27 vs 48</p>
<p> Taxes						   17 vs 18</p>
<p> Minorities					   nil vs 7 charge</p>
<p> Net profit					    10 vs 23</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    18.8 vs 23.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish mining equipment group is Tamrock Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245, news@reuters.fi</p>
